- [Component Scan](/learning/spring-boot-tutorial/component-scan): find out how Spring discovers your classes.
- [Spring vs Spring Boot](/learning/spring-boot-tutorial/spring-vs-spring-boot): compare the framework with the tool built on top.$sb6$)),
